  "question": {
    "text": "Let the sum of the maximum and the minimum values of the function $f(x)=\\frac{2 x^2-3 x+8}{2 x^2+3 x+8}$ be $\\frac{\\mathrm{m}}{\\mathrm{n}}$, where $\\operatorname{gcd}(\\mathrm{m}, \\mathrm{n})=1$. Then $\\mathrm{m}+\\mathrm{n}$ is equal to :",
