  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned} & y=\\frac{2 x^2-3 x+8}{2 x^2+3 x+8} \\\\ & x^2(2 y-2)+x(3 y+3)+8 y-8=0 \\\\ & \\text { use } D \\geq 0 \\\\ & (3 y+3)^2-4(2 y-2)(8 y-8) \\geq 0 \\\\ & (11 y-5)(5 y-11) \\leq 0 \\\\ & \\Rightarrow y \\in\\left[\\frac{5}{11}, \\frac{11}{5}\\right] \\\\ & y=1 \\text { is also included }\\end{aligned}$",
    "image": null
  },
